{
  "message": "I can help you compare and set this up. To access your account, check closure eligibility, and open new accounts, please provide any 2 of these 4 identity details: date of birth, email address, phone number, or address. Please also confirm that these are personal accounts, and tell me whether you want the new checking account optimized for premium perks, fee reduction, or savings-rate benefits.",
